{"unit_id":"shutongX__dsh-session-message#card-zh","repo":"shutongX/dsh-session-message","commit":"4c22a981b8338b7d9ece7d05d46a9bc86fb457b0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-message 是 DSH 的跨会话消息插件，注册 session_list 和 session_send 两个工具。它可以按工作区、标题或会话 ID 查找同一 DSH 主机上的会话，并将消息作为用户消息发送；支持排队等待下一回合或插入运行中会话的下一步。适合需要在多个工作区会话之间传递任务和回复的用户。无需额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:304-328","lib/core.js:64-96"]}
{"unit_id":"shutongX__dsh-session-message#card-en","repo":"shutongX/dsh-session-message","commit":"4c22a981b8338b7d9ece7d05d46a9bc86fb457b0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-message adds session_list and session_send tools to DSH. Find same-host sessions by workspace, title, or ID, then send a user-role message queued for the next turn or steered into a running turn. Useful for passing tasks and replies between sessions. No API key is configured.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:304-328","lib/core.js:64-96"]}
