{"unit_id":"shutongX__dsh-session-message#feature-list","repo":"shutongX/dsh-session-message","commit":"4c22a981b8338b7d9ece7d05d46a9bc86fb457b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-message 的功能「列出并筛选会话」：session_list 汇总同一主机各工作区可联系的会话，可按工作区、标题或 ID 过滤，并返回会话状态。 通过调用相应工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:151-169"]}
{"unit_id":"shutongX__dsh-session-message#feature-send","repo":"shutongX/dsh-session-message","commit":"4c22a981b8338b7d9ece7d05d46a9bc86fb457b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-message 的功能「跨会话发送消息」：session_send 可通过会话 ID 或唯一标题选择目标，把正文作为用户消息投递，并在写入会话日志确认后返回结果。 通过调用相应工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:171-229"]}
{"unit_id":"shutongX__dsh-session-message#feature-delivery","repo":"shutongX/dsh-session-message","commit":"4c22a981b8338b7d9ece7d05d46a9bc86fb457b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-message 的功能「选择投递方式」：发送时可选择 queue，让目标在下一回合处理；也可选择 steer，把消息插入正在运行会话的下一步。 通过调用相应工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:183-206"]}
{"unit_id":"shutongX__dsh-session-message#feature-reply","repo":"shutongX/dsh-session-message","commit":"4c22a981b8338b7d9ece7d05d46a9bc86fb457b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-message 的功能「携带回复地址」：收到的消息会附上发送方会话 ID 和回复提示，目标可以再次调用 session_send 将答复发回原会话。 通过调用相应工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core.js:116-128"]}
{"unit_id":"shutongX__dsh-session-message#caveat-scope","repo":"shutongX/dsh-session-message","commit":"4c22a981b8338b7d9ece7d05d46a9bc86fb457b0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-message 只能在同一 DSH 进程内的会话间投递；归档会话和子代理会话不能作为目标，发送方也不能是子代理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:122-127","lib/index.js:171-176"]}
